<h1>About</h1>
<p>A wiki-linked digital commonplace book. Sister site to <a href="https://brennan.day">brennan.day</a>.</p>

<p>This site is a personal knowledge garden built with <a href="https://www.11ty.dev/">Eleventy</a>, featuring wiki-links, backlinks, and CSS-only hover previews for footnotes and transclusions.</p>

<p>Entries are organized by type with a shared symbol taxonomy:</p>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Notes</strong>: Longer-form ideas and concepts</li>
  <li><strong>Quotes</strong>: Passages worth remembering</li>
  <li><strong>Bookmarks</strong>: Links to external resources</li>
  <li><strong>Diary</strong>: Personal logs and reflections</li>
  <li><strong>Snippets</strong>: Code and technical notes</li>
  <li><strong>Stubs</strong>: Placeholder pages for future development</li>
</ul>

<p>See the <a href="/legend/">legend</a> for symbol details.</p>
